退货与费用的批评","亚马逊卖家账号AmazonASGTG转发@BowTiedBroke的帖文，称其为“传奇”。被转发帖文作者自述在亚马逊销售15年，认为这可能是最后一年，并批评平台在退货纠纷中偏向买家、费用高企（包括低库存费），以及小卖家面临竞争压力；这些均为该卖家的个人说法，本站尚未独立核验。",{"_115":198},"2026-10-20T18:02:23.000Z","2026-10-20T18:11:41.348Z",[112,131,263],18,[],{"_143":186,"_145":187,"_147":188,"_149":189,"_92":385,"_152":386},[],{"_143":387,"_145":387,"_216":388,"_218":-5},"BowTiedBroke","After 15 yrs, I think this will be my last year selling on Amazon. It has now become a DEN OF THIEVES. Buyers purchase an expensive item, receive it, claim it's damaged, return it (but what the buyer returns is usually some broken junk they had laying around their house, while they keep what was in the box they received). Amazon issues a refund to the buyer and the seller can be out thousands of dollars. And Amazon ALWAYS sides with the buyer, rarely the seller.  \n\nIt is also now overrun by Chinese sellers hijacking small mom & pop listings & getting take down orders on the mom & pop listings as I outline in my post below from 2025. And there is literally nothing the small US businesses can do to rectify it. \n\nAnd now the fees they charge almost make it impossible to make a profit. One absurd fee they rolled out is a \"Low inventory fee\". If you run out of stock of an item because it sells fast, you get charged a fee FOR BEING OUT OF STOCK. Heaven forbid your supplier is out of stock, or you just don't have any extra inventory of that item, they'll still whack you with a fee each month for not having inventory at their fulfillment center for them to ship out. Coupled with all the other fees they charge, you can easily hit 40% of your sales revenue going straight to Amazon in fees now. That doesn't include YOUR costs, like cost of goods, packaging, etc. \n\nAfter 15 years, to me, it's just really not worth it anymore. It's been a good run but they've made it almost impossible for small third party sellers to make a profit. They prioritized the low cost Chinese knock offs years ago and now seem to prioritize complete thievery all in the name of Bezos' original mission of being the \"Earth’s most customer-centric company.” The first and most important principle of Amazon's Leadership Principles is \"Customer Obsession\". \n\nBut I'll add one tweak: \"Customer Obsession: Even if the customer is a blatant thief\"   \n\n(A recent screenshot of a discussion on their seller forums)","k019k6agv4ojxo64yc6acny7k","美国IOR监管趋严，亚马逊提醒卖家自查进口主体","亚马逊向美国站卖家发送风险提示邮件，提醒核实发货使用的IOR（进口备案人）属于美国本土实体还是境外实体。此次变动源于2026年6月3日签署的第14411号行政令《加强海关执法》，要求国土安全部与CBP在2026年11月30日前完成进口商资质条款修订。","原文梳理了美国IOR新规对进口商资质和保证金的收紧要求，并给出了卖家自查货代配套IOR属性的具体步骤。",{"_115":116},"2026-10-20T18:19:00.000Z","2026-10-21T02:23:12.996Z",[112,131,197],74,{"_108":404,"_110":111},[400],{"_96":97,"_98":401,"_100":402,"_102":403,"_104":-5,"_105":-5,"_106":-5,"_107":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/d031d52c2a21e8ae.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/d031d52c2a21e8ae.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/d031d52c2a21e8ae.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/d031d52c2a21e8ae.webp 720w","北美电商资讯","mvgctlme911hgedejhturnhzg","亚马逊群发“NWD品牌移除”通知系系统误发，持有品牌代表角色卖家可忽略","亚马逊向部分卖家群发“无批发分销（NWD）”计划下的商品移除通知，经客服核实该消息为系统自动发送，适用于所有关联卖家。若账户持有品牌代表角色，则不会面临停用风险，可直接忽略；非品牌代表需尽快获取授权，否则2026年10月27日后库存将被移除。",{"_115":246},"2026-10-20T18:39:00.000Z","2026-10-21T09:41:08.911Z",[112,131,374],{"_108":245,"_110":111},[414],{"_96":97,"_98":99,"_100":101,"_102":103,"_104":-5,"_105":-5,"_106":-5,"_107":-5},"wde6g36eie3i7b60trgdrpdi8","亚马逊推多渠道工具整合 eBay 等数据，作者质疑卖家共享意愿","亚马逊推出新的多渠道工具，旨在将 eBay、Shopify、TikTok 和 Walmart 的商品详情页、订单及利润数据整合至 Seller Central。作者指出该功能虽提供便利，但质疑卖家是否愿意向亚马逊开放其他销售渠道的数据。",{"_115":198},"2026-10-20T19:45:38.000Z","2026-10-20T20:15:41.290Z",[373,114,131,295],[],{"_143":186,"_145":187,"_147":188,"_149":189,"_92":424,"_152":-5},[425],{"_96":97,"_98":426,"_100":427,"_102":428,"_104":429,"_105":430,"_106":-5,"_107":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 336w, /